  "content": "\n\n<center>\n\n![卡通材質包標頭](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I8Wm3eT9/images/a6cce411bebaa8a9a06b992c845b5afdd08a8c08.jpeg)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">卡通材質包</font></strong></span></center>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/cartoon-texture-pack\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cartoon-texture-pack\">\n  <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"ghsponsors-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\n會動的雙眼！傻乎乎的笑容！用這個材質包將你的世界變身為卡通風格吧。\n<p></p>\n\n此材質包為方塊、物品、實體與介面加入了主題風格的紋理。\n<p></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>預覽</summary>\n\n![世界預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I8Wm3eT9/images/4381a8116d5a7aac50e383278b16d61cdda032dc.jpeg)\n\n![苦力怕追逐玩家](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I8Wm3eT9/images/d19e5c02d63902480ca71507869c44893065abee.jpeg)\n\n![狼跑向隧道繪畫](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I8Wm3eT9/images/67caf6363d0d05ef1395739c0ff018f6174d9da2.jpeg)\n\n![材質對比](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/I8Wm3eT9/images/ceb7bf408d4d278c47268367b1cca4012b972396.jpeg)\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>更多資源包</summary>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <